  Returns the layout guide for a Leadbay tool's result: the table shape, the
  score-bar computation, the link rules and the fallbacks. Use when a result
  carries `render.guide` and you want the full recipe. Don't use it to fetch
  lead data, and don't call it when the one-line `render.recipe` on the result
